<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">Wunzole wu Timote</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timote</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wunzole wu Pawuli ku Timote</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wunzole wu Pawuli ku</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timote</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda wunzole Pawuli wu kasonika ku Timote. Mu ntangu yi kaba mu boloko ku Loma kasonika wo. Bakundi bandi bamvimba batina na basala munyafuna. Ni yandi hiika Luka wudi dokotolo, wulembolo mu nyafuna.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawuli wuyena ti ntangu andi yilunga, kisaala kaka ni mu fwa. Ni hahoho kabongila nzengolo ye sonikina Timote mu muhaana malongi, mu dyambu ti wumubongila bonso mwana andi. Mukanda bewowo Pawuli wukasonika ni wu mansukina.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wumuteela mu mukanda ti kasyama mu kiminu bonso yandi. Wumuteela dyaka mu tatamana mu longa Mambu ma Yesu, kaati ni bamukwamisa. Na mu lwenga mu momomo malembolo fwanakana na Musamu Wumbote.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pawuli wubwesa ta dyaka ti yandi bende wunwana nwanunu yimbote, wuna kwenda muba kintwadi na Mfumu Yesu. Wuta ti kani muklisto fweti sa bonso bu kakwe sanga yandi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Tala bonso budi ndandani yi misamu mu buuku bedidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Zimbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1.1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Pawuli wuna haana malongi ku Timote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 1:3-18">1.3-18</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Bwedi muntu kafweni beela soda dimbote di Klisto (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 2:1-26">2.1-26</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Bwedi bantu baabeela mu bilumbu bi nsukunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 3:1-9">3.1-9</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Kusyama nakekete mu kiminu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 3:10-4:8">3.10–4.8</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Manyongo, na mbote yi mansukina (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:9-22">4.9-22</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Meno Pawuli, ntumwa yi Yesu Klisto mu luzolo lu Nzambi mu samuna nsilulu yi luzingu luu mu Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="2TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />Nasonikini ku ngeye Timote, mwana ani wu natomini tya. Bika Nzambi Tata, na Yesu Klisto Mfumu eto bakusakumuna, bakufwila nkenda na bakuhaana kiyenge!<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli wuna haana ndongosolo ku Timote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Mpimpa na mwini, bu nakwe sambilanga, nkwe kubambukilanga moyo na nkwe vutulanga matondo ku Nzambi, yina kwe sadilanga mu mutima wuvedila bonso busadila zinkaka zani. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Nina bambuka moyo mu mansangasa maku mpe nii na mpwila yiyingi mu kuyena mwanki naba wufuluka mu kyese. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Nakwe kubambukilanga moyo mu kiminu kikedika kii mu ngeye. Tekila ngeye, kiminu bekyokyo kitwadisa Loyise nkaka aku yi mukento na ngudi aku Enise, nina kwikila ti ni kyakyokyo mpe kii mu ngeye. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Ni hahoho, nina kubambula moyo ti: lemisa munkayulu wukuhaana Nzambi mu ntangu yi nakutentika moko. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Mu dyambu ti, Nzambi katuhaana Mpeve yi bunkuta ko, kansi Mpeve yi lulendo, yi luzolo, na yi madyela.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Buna kuyenandi nsoni ko mu ta kimbangi ki Mfumu eto na ki meno nidi nkole mu dyambu dyandi. Kansi, yena mpasi ha kimosi naani mu dyambu di Musamu Wumbote na ku sa kivuvu mu lulendo lu Nzambi. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Yandi wutuvuukisa na wututumisa mu mbokolo yilongo, ka mu dyambu di mavanga meto mambote ko, kansi mu dyambu di makani mandi na bumbote bwandi bu katusila mu Yesu-Klisto mimvu ka mimvu, <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />mpe bwakayenikisi bwabu mu nyizulu yi Yesu-Klisto, Muvuukisi eto. Yandi wubedisi lulendo lu lufwa, mpe mu Musamu Wumbote, wunata ku kya luzingu lu mimvu ka mimvu.<verse eid="2TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Nzambi wunsoola mu ba mulongi na ntumwa, mu longa Musamu Wumbote bewuwu, <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />ni hahoho nina yenina mpasi bezizi. Kansi nina yena nsoni ko, mu dyambu ti nzebi mu nani nsididi kivuvu, mpe nina kwikila ti, yandi wuu na lulendo mu keba mimvimba mi kampeeni, natee mu kilumbu ki mfundusu. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Landa kifwani ki mpova zimbote zi wuyudi ku meno, mpe kangama mu kiminu na luzolo bii neto mu kintwadi na Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="2TI 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Simbidila ndongosolo zimbote zi bakuheeni mu lusadusu lu Mpeve Yilongo yikwe zinganga mu yeto.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Wazebi ti, bamvimba bebobo baa ku kizunga ki Aziya banyafuni, mu kati dyawu tuu na Fingeli na Elemongeni. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Bika Mfumu kalonka nkenda zandi ku kanda di Onesifoli, mu dyambu ti yandi wedi mbombanga kadi ntangu bu naba mu boloko, na kedi nyeninanga nsoni ko. <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />Ni bwabobo, bu katuula ku mbanza yi Loma, wunsosa mu muswalu natee bu kayiza mbakula. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Bika Mfumu kamufwila nkenda ha ntadisi yi Nzambi mu kilumbu ki mfundusu. Ngebende tomini zaba lusadusu lu kampaana ku mbanza yi Efeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mbulu-mbulu yi Klisto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Bwabu ngeye, mwana ani, baka nsyamusunu mu bumbote buu mu Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Ndongosolo yi wuyudi yi nasamuni ha ntadisi yi zimbangi zizingi, haana yo ku bantu bakwikama balendi longa yo dyaka ku bahiika.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Yena mpasi naani ha kimosi bonso mbulu-mbulu yimbote yi Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Kuu mbulu-mbulu ko yikiheeni mu sala kisalu, mboki yina landa misamu mi yobobo balembolo ba zimbulu-mbulu, tala ti tiidi mu yangidika mfumu andi yi mubonga mu kisalu. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Bumosi mpe ku muntu kwe nookanga ntiinu, balendi muhaana mpu yi nungunu ko tala ti kavumini misiku ko. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Kisadi ki mfuba kikwe salanga kisalu kimpasi, kafweti banga wuntete mu baka kikunku kyandi ki nyonzokolo. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Yindula misamu mi nina ta mpe Mfumu waakuhaana madyela mu bakula mimvimba.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Bambuka moyo mu Yesu-Klisto wubutuka mu nkuna yi Davidi, wufuluka mu bafwa, bonso budi Musamu Wumbote wu nakwe samunanga. <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />Ni mu Musamu Wumbote bewowo nina yenina mpasi, mpe nidi wukangama mu misinga mi bisengo bonso kimpumbulu. Kansi Mambu ma Nzambi madi makangama ko. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Ni hahoho, nina vibidilanga misamu mimvimba mu dyambu di yobobo Nzambi bakasoola, mwanki yawu mpe batambula mpulusu yii mu Yesu-Klisto na nkembo wu mimvu ka mimvu. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Mambu bemama makedika madi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">«Tala ti tuu bafwa ha kimosi nandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:11">twaazinga mpe ha kimosi nandi.<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Tala ti tuna vibidila,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">twaayaala mpe ha kimosi nandi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">Tala ti tuna mubisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:12">yandi mpe waatubisa.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Tala ti tuu bakwikama ko,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">yandi waatatamana muba wukwikama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2TI 2:13">mu dyambu ti kalendi kibisa yandi bende ko.»<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kisadi kina yangidika Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Bambula moyo misamu bemyomyo ku bamvimba, mpe bateela ha ntadisi yi Nzambi, balembolo bindasana mpaka mu zimpova. Kadi mpaka zii mfunu ko, zawu zikwe zimbisa yobobo bana yuwa zo. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Sadila ngolo mu ba kisadi kimbote ha meso ma Nzambi, bonso kisadi kina lembolo yena nsoni mu kisalu kyandi, kina samuna mu ludedomo Mambu mandi makedika. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Tina nzonzolo zimpamba mpe zilembolo fwanakana na kiminu. Mu dyambu ti yobobo bakwe sanga bobo, baavula ba kitatu na Nzambi, <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />na ndongosolo awu yidi bonso mputa yibola yina kwe yalangani. Mabanza mani mana tadisa ku Imene na Filetosi. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Bakatukidi mu nzila yi kikedika, na bazimbikisi kiminu ki bantu babingi mu ta ti mfulukulu eto mu bafwa yikibeela. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Kansi lufulu lungolo lutunga Nzambi ludi lutelama nakekete. Mpova ezi basonika ha yulu lufulu belolo: «Mfumu zebi bantu bandi», mpe: «Wonso muntu wuna ta ti vwihulu ku Mfumu, fweti sisa misamu mimbi.»<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Mu kati dinzo yiyinene, mudi kaka na ndonga zi wola na zi palata ko, kansi mudi mpe na ndonga zi bahala mu muti, na zibahidikila mu tubumba. Zintete, zazozo bakwe sadilanga mu kilumbu ki mukembo, zimanunu zazozo zikwe sadulungu kadi kilumbu. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Tala ti muntu wuna kivedisa mu misamu mimvimba mimbi mi nazonzidi, waafwanakana na ndonga yikwe sadulungu mu ntangu yi mikembo, weka mvimba wuvwihulu ku mfumu andi, muntu wu mfunu mu sadila mfumu andi, na wukubama mu sala kyonso-kyonso kisalu kimbote .<verse eid="2TI 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Tina nsatu zimbi zi kintwenya, mpe sosa lunungu, kiminu, luzolo, kiyenge ha kimosi na yobobo bakwe sambilanga Mfumu mu mutima wuvedila. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Kansi tina mpaka zibuzengi na zilembolo ba na ndandu: zawu zikwe tulumunanga mayuma. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Kisadi ki Mfumu kilendi yumana ko. Kansi kifweti ba muntu wuzolakana ha ntadisi yi bamvimba, mwanki kaba na lulendo lwe longa na lwe vibidila misamu mimbi. <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />Yandi fweti semba mitantu mu lembami: kampe Nzambi waabahaana nzila ye viluka na ye zaaba kikedika. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Bu baavutukila mabanza mawu mambote, baakuuluka bwabu mu mitambu mi nkadyampemba, wubabwila na wubatuula ku nsye luyaalu lwandi.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Bilumbu bimanunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Zaba ti mu bilumbu bimanunu, ntangu zimpasi zaabwa. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Mu dyambu ti bantu baaba na bwimi, nzodi yi mbongo, na mayama, baakitumpidika, mpe baaba mintyaki mi Nzambi. Baatumimina matata na zingudi zawu ko, baatonda muntu ko, na baaba na kivumi mu bima bilongo ko. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Baaba na mitima mikangama, baaba na nkenda ko, baatoola bantu, baalembana mu kukiyaala, baaba na mbalu, na baaba mitantu mi mambote. <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />Baayekola bantu, baahidika misamu mimbi, mpe baakitumpidika bubwingi, baavula tya mikembo mi nza, kansi ka Nzambi ko. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Yawu baakiyenikisa ti bantu bakangama mu Nzambi badi, kansi bakwe bisanga lulendo lwandi. Ba kitatu na bantu babobo! <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Bantu bahiika ha kati dyawu bakwe kotanga mu zinzo mu baka mu mintambu myawu bakento balembolo ba basyama mu kiminu na baa bafuluka mu masumu, mpe bakwe twadusungu mu zinzinunu zimumpila mu mpila. <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />Bakwe longokanga ntangu zimvimba, kansi bakwe lembananga mu zaba kikedika. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Bumosi mpe Zanesi na Zambesi bu babindisa Mose mpaka, ni bwabobo mpe bantu bebobo bana bindisila kikedika mpaka. Yawu baa na madyela mambi na kiminu kyawu kimpamba kidi. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Kansi baakwenda kukula ko, mu dyambu ti bantu bamvimba baazaba buzengi bwawu, bonso bubeela kifwani ki Zanesi na Zambesi.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Malongi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Kansi ngeye, wutomini landa bumbote ndongosolo zani, ndyatulu ani, makani mani, kiminu kyani, mvibudulu ani, luzolo lwani, na lutatumunu lwani, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />mboki mpe mfyetokoso na mpasi zi nayena mu mbanza yi Antiose, na yi Ikonyomi, na yi Lisiteli. Nkye mpila mfyetekoso zibobo zi nayena. Kansi Mfumu wunkuula mu zimvimba! <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Kedika, yobobo bamvimba batiidi mu zinga mu Yesu Klisto, baafyetokoso. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Kansi bantu baa na mutima wumbalu na banga luvunu baatatamana kaka mu hidika misamu mimbi. Baahuna bahiika, na yabende mpe baabahuna. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Kansi ngeye kangama nakekete mu misamu mi wulongokidi mpe miwutambudi ti mikedika midi. Ngebende zebi ku banani wulongokidi myo. <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />Tuuka bumwana bwaku, ngeye zebi Masonama Malongo. Malenda kuhaana ndwenga mu baka mpulusu mu kiminu mu Yesu Klisto. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Masonama mamvimba mafuma ku Nzambi, mpe madi mfunu mu longa, mu semba, mu sungika na mu haana ndongosolo mu lunungu. <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />Mwanki muntu wu Nzambi kaba wulongoka na wukubama, mu sala kyonso-kyonso kisalu kimbote.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Nina kubombidila ha ntadisi yi Nzambi na yi Yesu-Klisto wuna fundisa bamoyo na bafwa mu ntangu yi nyizulu andi na yi kimfumu kyandi: <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />longa mambu ma Nzambi, mpe tatamana mu longa mo mu ntangu yimbote hoti yimbi. Sungika, semba na syamisa mu ndongosolo na mu luvibudulu lulwingi. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Mu dyambu ti, ntangu yaakwiza yina ba ti bantu baabwesa tya mu yuwa ndongosolo yikedika ko, kansi baatya mu landa nsatu zi yawu bende. Baazungudulu ku milongisi mimingi, myaabateela misamu mi bakwe tyanga mu yuwa. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Baaduka makutu mawu mu bisa kikedika mwanki bayuwa bimpa. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Kansi ngeye ba muntu wu ludedomo, vibidila zimpasi, sadila ngolo mu samuna Musamu Wumbote, na lungisa kisalu kyaku ki Nzambi natee ku nsukunu.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Mu dyambu ti, mu meno kilokola kifweni ki nina yekolo bonso munkayulu, mpe ntangu ani ye sisa nza yifweni. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Nanweni mvita yimbote, namanisi mu nooka ntiinu mpe nakebidi kiminu. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Bwabu musendo wu ndungunu wuna nkingila. Ni mpu yi mpulusu yaampana Mfumu, Mumfundisi wulunungu, mu kilumbu kyaaba mfundusu. Ka kuu meno kaka ko kaahaana yo, kansi mpe ku bantu bamvimba bana kingila mu luzolo kilumbu ki kaayenika.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawuli wuna teela Timote kiza kamubata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Sadila ngolo mu kwiza mu muswalu ku nidi, <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />mu dyambu ti, Demasi wunyafuni mu dyambu di byese bi nza bi ntangu beyiyi, na wuyenzi kwandi ku mbanza yi Tesalonika. Kelesikesi wuyenzi ku kizunga ki Ngalatiya, mboki Tito ku kizunga ki Dalamasi. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Luka kwandi wudi naani kintwadi. Yizeeno yeno na Malako, mu dyambu ti mfunu kadi naani mu kisalu ki Mfumu. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Natambikidi Tisiki ku mbanza yi Efeso. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Bu waakwiza, ntwadila kiyunga kina sala sisa ku mbanza Towasi ku nzo yi Kalepusi. Yiza mpe na mabuuku, sungula mabuuku mahiduku mu mikanda mi bibulu.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Alezandeli kisadi ki bisengo, wunyenisi mpasi zizingi. Mfumu waamusenda mu myo mi kampidikidi. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Ngeye mpe, keba kwaku mu yandi, mu dyambu ti yandi nkatika mbeni yi zindongosolo zeto kadi.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Nkumbu yintete yi nasamba mu nzo yi lufundusu mu nwanina nitu ani, nakani muntu kaba kintwadi naani ko mu nsyamisa, bamvimba bamana ntina. Bika Nzambi kalembolo babakila wo kibila. <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Kansi Mfumu wunsadisi na wunsyamisi natee bu na samuni Mambu mandi mpe nayuwikisi mo ku bamvimba balembolo ba Bayudayo. Bwabobo Mfumu kankuudidi mu munwa wu nkosi. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Mfumu waankuula mu nsadulu zimvimba zimbi, mpe waamvuukisa mu nkotisa mu Kimfumu kyandi ki yulu. Bika nkembo wuba ku yandi mimvu ka mimvu! Ameni!<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zimbote zi mansukina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Haana mbote ku Pilisile na Akilase na ku kanda di Onesifoli. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Elasiti wusidi ku mbanza Kolinto na Tofimi wubeela namusisidi ku mbanza Mile. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Sadila ngolo mu tuula tekila tukota mu ntangu yi nsungi yi kyozi kingolo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Ebulusi, Pudesi, Linusi, Kolodya na mpangi zimvimba zihiika, mbote bakutambikidi.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Bika Mfumu [Yesu Klisto] kaba naku! Bika lusakumunu lu Nzambi luba neeno!<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>